Package: mediamatch
Version: VERSION
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgl1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-cursor0
Maintainer: Bryan Montgomery <bmontgomery@montymail.tech>
Homepage: https://github.com/Bmontythe3rd/mediamatch
Description: Rename media folders to Plex/Jellyfin naming conventions
 MediaMatch automatically renames your media folders to the naming
 conventions expected by Plex and Jellyfin. Point it at a folder full
 of movies or TV shows, preview the proposed renames, and apply in
 one click.
